+### Compound Durations
+
+`parseCompound` sums several duration pieces. Pieces are separated by whitespace and/or a comma, and each piece needs a unit. It throws a `TypeError` for invalid input.
+
+```ts
+import { parseCompound } from "ms";
+
+parseCompound("1h 30m"); // 5400000
+parseCompound("1h, 30m"); // 5400000
+parseCompound("2 days 4 hours"); // 187200000
+```
